 "name_en": "Purchase Contract (BMD)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Purchase Contract (BMD)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio17ad828d507040a18b4c5d59823b7bd8\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio17ad828d507040a18b4c5d59823b7bd8__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Quantity contracts are agreements for a company to order a certain quantity of a product during a specified period. In source determination, contracts replace the purchasing information records and can be assigned in the source list as the fixed source for MRP.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Target groups are purchasing managers as well as buyers. If purchase requisitions and purchase orders do not yet exist, they are created after the contract. You can check the released purchase orders that are referenced to a contract by monitoring the contract.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio17ad828d507040a18b4c5d59823b7bd8__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create a purchase contract</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Make mass changes to purchase contracts</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Approve purchase contract</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Monitor notification (optional)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage source lists</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create a purchase requisition</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Assign requisition and creating purchase order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Find purchase documents by requirement tracking number</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Approve purchase orders</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Monitor contract item (optional)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post goods receipt</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create supplier invoice</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio17ad828d507040a18b4c5d59823b7bd8__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduce procurement costs</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Secure supplies</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Maintain transparency of supplier agreements</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>采购合同 (BMD)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio17ad828d507040a18b4c5d59823b7bd8\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio17ad828d507040a18b4c5d59823b7bd8__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">数量合同是公司在指定期间内，订购一定数量产品的协议。在货源确定中，合同替换采购信息记录，并且可以在货源清单中作为 MRP 的固定货源进行分配。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">目标组包括采购经理和采购员。如果采购申请和采购订单尚不存在，则在合同之后创建。您可以通过监控合同检查参考合同的已下达采购订单。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio17ad828d507040a18b4c5d59823b7bd8__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建采购合同</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">批量更改采购合同</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">审批采购合同</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">监控通知（可选）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">管理货源清单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建采购申请</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">分配申请并创建采购订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">按需求跟踪号查找采购凭证</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">审批采购订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">监控合同项目（可选）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">过账收货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建供应商发票</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio17ad828d507040a18b4c5d59823b7bd8__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">降低采购成本</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">安全供应</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">维护供应商协议的透明度</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
